# What must NOT ship in the extension.
#
# Without this file `vsce package` takes the whole directory: sources, tests, tsconfig, the lot.
# It was caught by the packager's own secret scan finding a token in a test — a synthetic one,
# written as a fixture for our own scanner, but the finding was right about the shape of the
# problem: the tests were being published at all.
#
# The extension is a single bundled file. Everything that produced it stays here.
src/**
test/**
node_modules/**
tsconfig*.json
vitest.config.*
*.map
.vscodeignore
